# server/Dockerfile is built with the repo root as context, so the root
# /.dockerignore is the file docker actually reads. This copy is kept in sync
# for builders that resolve the ignore file next to the Dockerfile instead.
# It must NOT exclude runner/: its sources are bundled into the server image as
# the build context for `ensureRunnerImage` (server/src/runner.ts). `**/dist`
# stays excluded on purpose - runner/Dockerfile runs its own npm ci and build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.smoke-work

.git
.github
android
data
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.env
.env.*
